 17+  5DB9 1C               inc e
 18+  5DBA C2 B8 5D         jp nz,.fill_loop
 19+  5DBD 14               inc d
 20+  5DBE 12               ld (de),a
 21+  5DBF 36 C3            ld (hl),$C3
 22+  5DC1 2C               inc l
 23+  5DC2 36 CB            ld (hl),low im2_handler
 24+  5DC4 2C               inc l
 25+  5DC5 36 5D            ld (hl),high im2_handler
 26+  5DC7 ED 5E            im 2
 27+  5DC9 FB               ei
 28+  5DCA C9               ret
